00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:09,797
room CHAPTER 11 For years, Dorian Gray could not free himself from the influence of this book.

2
00:00:09,797 --> 00:00:13,520
Or perhaps it would be more accurate to say that he never sought to free himself

3
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:20,119
from it. He procured from Paris no less than n large paper copies of the first

4
00:00:20,119 --> 00:00:24,919
edition, and had them bound in different colors so that they might suit his

5
00:00:24,919 --> 00:00:30,080
various moods and the changing fancies of a nature over which he seemed, at

6
